ggml-webgpu: size the K-quant MMVQ mat-vec workgroup to the row (K = 2560 -> 160 threads instead
of 256 with 6 of 16 block slots idle). Same blocks per thread, same reductions: identical results.

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-webgpu/ggml-webgpu-shader-lib.hpp b/ggml/src/ggml-webgpu/ggml-webgpu-shader-lib.hpp
